        "tree": {
            "0": {
                "text": "Curious. What manner of creature are you?",
                "choices": {
                    "0": {
                        "text": "You are?",
                        "tree": {
                            "0": {
                                "text": "Hmm, curious indeed… You should not be here, human. The astral planes are not meant for your kind.",
                                "choices": {
                                    "0": {
                                        "text": "Who are you?!",
                                        "tree": {
                                            "0": {
                                                "text": "Ha… what a question. Why must we be someone? Why can’t we be everyone? Or no one at all? Does it make a difference in the grand scheme of the cosmos as it unfurls? There are some that call us Sephotep, but we are known by many names…"
                                            },
                                            "1": {
                                                "text": "Now, tell me creature. Why are you here, at the altar of this insignificant being? This… Ba’al?",
                                                "choices": {
                                                    "0": {
                                                        "text": "I need him to bless this horn…",
                                                        "tree": {
                                                            "0": {
                                                                "text": "The horn of a Narwhal. I remember such a creature from my time on your world. But why? Your efforts are like that of an ant, casting a prayer over the nose of a gnat…"
                                                            },
                                                            "1": {
                                                                "text": "No. I don’t care. But still… curious indeed… Go ahead. <c=pc>Place the horn upon the glowing altar and receive a blessing.</c> This blind, idiot god will not withhold it from you…",
                                                                "choices": {
                                                                    "0": {
                                                                        "text": "Thank you?",
                                                                        "tree": {
                                                                            "0": {
                                                                                "setFlags": [
                                                                                    "qf_horn-blessed"
                                                                                ],
                                                                                "text": "Interesting things are happening in your realm. Interesting things indeed. Perhaps we need to visit again sometime. Perhaps we already have..."
                                                                            }
                                                                        }
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
